>wouldn't THAT be a real pain to meet without a shield of reflection?

And when you hit it with your sword, its heads get chopped off one by one.. :)

BTW, why is it that the player can kill _every_ monster in nethack? It would
seem natural that there exist so powerful monsters that they can't be killed
by the player. I remind you of Tolkien's world, where there are ancient
things beneath the earth far older and more powerful than Saruman and Gandalf.
These powerful creatures aren't very interested in you and the best course
of action would be to stay away from them, but since most players want to kill
everything in sight...

Anyway, I think this would be a welcome addition to the game. It would 
introduce a new strategy to game playing: running as fast as you can or trying 
to sneak past this creature.
